      "prompt": "Return only Python code for clamp(value, low, high). Return value bounded inclusively between low and high. Raise ValueError if low > high. Do not import modules.",
      "response": "```python\ndef clamp(value, low, high):\n    if low > high:\n        raise ValueError(\"low cannot be greater than high\")\n    return max(low, min(high, value))\n```",
